Z||000000||GodSend||09-03-2000||09:15 PM||||  I was wondering if there are any members in the Greater Toronto Area who woulden't mind helping out a new fiero owner on a upcoming weekend.<P>  I am certainly not mechanically enept, but I would appreciate a little help (paid of course) from someone who is experianced in solving hard warm start and idle hunting problems.<P>  SO far I have replaced the dist. cap, rotor, pcv valve, and air filter.  I am going  through everything I can find from the forum, but would appreciate any help.<P>  Let me know if anyone is available for a short saturday/sunday afternoon get together.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.hypernetcommunications.com/revn.gif"> ||||reg||6
